Made House, with you as Sam.
Send this link to the people you want in it. It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the link>

or, to open it in a browser:

  http://localhost:57054/#<the link>

On a phone, each app opens at an address of its own under localhost:57054, which can see which app is opened.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
